    old "Six Harmonies"
    new "Six Harmonies"

    old "《Six Harmonies · 六合奏》是一部支持中英双语切换的多结局叙事视觉小说，基于 Ren'Py 8 构建。\n\n六个性格迥异的同组伙伴，在两周的紧迫期限内共同完成一部游戏作品。玩家的每一次关键抉择与限时调度都会影响团队凝聚力，最终走向不同的结局。"
    new "Six Harmonies is a bilingual (Chinese / English) branching visual novel built with Ren'Py 8.\n\nSix teammates with clashing personalities are given two weeks to ship a playable game together. Every key decision and timed choice shapes team cohesion and leads to one of three endings."

